<title>FINLAND: MERITA BUYS REST OF HUONEISTOKESKUS.</title>
<headline>MERITA BUYS REST OF HUONEISTOKESKUS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish banking group Merita said in a statement on Monday it had acquired the remaining 30 percent of its real estate agency Huoneistokeskus from insurer Sampo's Teollisuusvakuutus unit for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;Merita has previously owned 70 percent of Huoneistokeskus shares, so the company is wholly owned,&quot; it said.  </p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
